{"productId": "39b12f53-47a9-46f3-98d4-89c689eace87", "modelName": "600+ Lux", "modelDescription": "The CZ 600+ LUX is a finely crafted centerfire hunting rifle that blends traditional European styling with modern modular features. It features a select walnut stock with a cheek piece and dark brown laminated forend, offering both elegance and reliable handling with its checkered grip. Engineered for precision, it delivers sub-MOA accuracy with match-grade factory ammunition, with each rifle tested at the factory to guarantee performance. Its cold hammer-forged barrel is optimized for its caliber, while the user-interchangeable barrel system allows easy caliber changes for different hunting or shooting needs. The rifle comes equipped with adjustable iron sights with removable fiber-optic inserts, a steel receiver compatible with Remington 700-style optic mounts, and a silent ambidextrous safety. It also incorporates CZ\u2019s patented controlled feed system and a removable bolt for safe, smooth operation. Built for durability, the metal components are finished with a deep BobOx nitriding treatment for superior corrosion resistance. A threaded muzzle and integrated sling loops add to its versatility, making the CZ 600+ LUX a refined yet practical choice for discerning hunters.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "3f023a23-956e-4dfa-af72-61c3bba9311a", "description": "CZ, 600+ Lux, Bolt Action, 308 Winchester, 20\" Threaded Barrel, Blued Finish, Turkish Walnut Stock, Right Hand, 5 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/8e2974f2-d7ef-4365-b062-a8410882c91c", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f0f706d9-afc3-4249-ab91-62e9284d6614", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e5f1381b-ca65-4eb0-8d10-8d8996c979e7", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/17ef2607-2a3a-4509-9d52-308f4e3dbe7e", "ht